msgid "https://github.com/LinkNacional/shipping-simulator-for-woocommerce"
msgstr "https://github.com/LinkNacional/shipping-simulator-for-woocommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: main.php
msgid ""
"Allows your customers to calculate shipping rates on the product and cart "
"pages, with free shipping rules and address autofill"
msgstr ""
"Permite que seus clientes calculem o frete nas páginas de produto e "
"carrinho, com regras de frete grátis e autopreenchimento de endereço"

